 "comment": "A01 Web Animations creation. Each case creates an animation, pauses it and seeks it; values come from getComputedStyle and the rendered pixels. Keyframes are the native keyframe-sequence form: props maps IDL attribute names to string values. An options number is a duration; \"NaN\" stands for NaN.",
 "markup": "<!doctype html><html><head><style>html,body{margin:0;background:white}.box{position:absolute;width:40px;height:40px;background:rgb(0,0,255)}#a{left:0;top:0}#b{left:50px;top:0}#c{left:100px;top:0;transform:translateX(10px)}#d{left:0;top:50px}#e{left:50px;top:50px;opacity:0.5}#f{left:100px;top:100px}</style><script>document.title=\"script ran\"</script></head><body><div id=a class=box></div><div id=b class=box></div><div id=c class=box></div><div id=d class=box></div><div id=e class=box></div><div id=f class=box></div></body></html>",
